      "components": [
        {
          "type": 10,
          "content": "### 📖 Tether\nTether runs your event's operations from this server. Six agents (finance, sponsorship, tasks, calendar, socials, helpdesk) do the work; you approve anything that spends money, sends email or posts publicly.\n\n**Three ways to ask**\n• **@mention Tether** anywhere, in plain words → it proposes a plan you can edit and run.\n• **A slash command** runs one team's agent right away, e.g. `/budget summary`.\n• **`/agent`** opens a thread with one agent that remembers the conversation.\n\n**Nothing happens behind your back.** Every side effect is a card with Approve, Edit and Reject. A running plan has a Stop button on its status card."
        },
        {
          "type": 14,
          "divider": true,
          "spacing": 1
        },
        {
          "type": 10,
          "content": "**Start here**\n1. `/tether setup name:… sheet_id:… calendar_id:…`\n2. `/tether channels` → team channels and roles\n3. `/plan request:Shopify confirmed $2k, kick off onboarding`\n\n-# Pick a topic below for more."
        },
        {
          "type": 10,
          "content": "-# help · 1 of 8"
